{"id":"n25470-1-9","stage":2,"title":"초청장 · 请帖","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25470-1-9-1","ko":"유민아, 나한테 전시회 초청장이 두 장 있는데 같이 갈래?","zh":"裕敏啊，我这儿有两张展览邀请函，要一起去吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}},{"text":"나한테","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나한테","audio":"/audio/a650b718a38da6e97157.mp3"}},{"text":"전시회","meaning":"展览会、展览","explanation":"전시회：展览会、展览。","readings":[{"term":"전시회","audio":"/audio/2238ab819aaac418f808.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31692","senseId":"1","lemma":"전시회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전시회","audio":"/audio/2238ab819aaac418f808.mp3"}},{"text":"초청장이","meaning":"请帖","explanation":"초청장：请帖；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"초청장","audio":"/audio/019ffa368e87fbe7c09c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25470","senseId":"1","lemma":"초청장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"초청장이","audio":"/audio/274830cda26d9143101f.mp3"}},{"text":"두","meaning":"两","explanation":"두：两。","readings":[{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71458","senseId":"1","lemma":"두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두","audio":"/audio/dfedd225bb659d500f65.mp3"}},{"text":"장","meaning":"张，枚，纸","explanation":"장：张，枚，纸。","readings":[{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29607","senseId":"1","lemma":"장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장","audio":"/audio/2dfdb434387c361c95cd.mp3"}},{"tex