9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d31d0c17ada4c7d6c25.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25470-1-9-2","ko":"좋아. 작가한테 직접 받았구나.","zh":"好啊。是直接从艺术家那儿拿到的呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"작가한테","meaning":"创作者、艺术家","explanation":"작가 的词典定义包括诗歌、小说、剧本和绘画等的原创者；展览邀请函语境中可指艺术家，不应限定为写小说的作家。한테 在这里表示从某人那里收到。","readings":[{"term":"작가","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58277","senseId":"1","lemma":"작가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작가한테","audio":"/audio/95722e8b55bc1c631c75.mp3"}},{"text":"직접","meaning":"亲手，亲自","explanation":"직접：亲手，亲自。","readings":[{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71493","senseId":"1","lemma":"직접","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"직접","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3"}},{"text":"받았구나.","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받았구나","audio":"/audio/4165aa243a854953b174.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"07dda968bf6b7241","term":"작가","zh":"作家、艺术创作者","audio":"/audio/07dda968bf6b7241b33c.mp3","entryId":"58277","definition":"作家、艺术创作者","pronunciation":["작까"]},{"id":"20c483bdda9706e4","term":"직접","zh":"亲手，亲自","audio":"/audio/20c483bdda9706e41f07.mp3","entryId":"71493","definition":"没有人或物介入在中间而直接。","pronunciation":["직쩝"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a95ed42e439771644fcb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.625,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25470","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4517,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊。是直接从艺术家那儿拿到的呢。","裕敏啊，我这儿有两张展览邀请函，要一起去吗？","你脸色怎么这么差？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏啊，我这儿有两张展览邀请函，要一起去吗？","你脸色怎么这么差？","好啊。是直接从艺术家那儿拿到的呢。"],"answer":2}]}
